{"3261250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dodgeball Blast", "steam_appid": 3261250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodgeball Blast</strong> is an action-packed boss rush adventure game where your dodgeball skills will be put to the ultimate test! Face off against 10 wild and wacky bosses, each with their own unique abilities and personalities, as you fight your way to becoming the ultimate Dodgeball Master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>10 Unique Bosses – Dodge, Throw, Survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261250/extras/1fda88eb3a30d148fcca5c3d0f9ebb62.avif?t=1787960089\" width=616 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a <strong>wild lineup of over-the-top bosses</strong>, each with their own crazy attacks and unpredictable dodgeball skills. From a <strong>Bigfoot brawler on the wing of a plane</strong> to a <strong>Kung Fu Dodgeball Master</strong>, every fight is a ridiculous showdown!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Minigames – More Than Just Dodgeball!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261250/extras/476eb76f106b6f32f51a5fd6b144a81e.avif?t=1787960089\" width=616 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the chaos with a variety of <strong>wacky minigames</strong> that test your reflexes, aim, and dodging prowess. Can you master the art of extreme dodgeball trick shots?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlockable Abilities – Power Up Your Game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261250/extras/3eaaa8ca4390de56680a8f8c87f88ccd.avif?t=1787960089\" width=616 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, <strong>earn and equip new abilities</strong> to enhance your dodgeball domination. Super-ninja speed, boomerang throws, and other insane skills will change how you take on the competition!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Local &amp; Online Multiplayer – Team Up or Throw Down!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261250/extras/54832815b23b672f53fb7aaf5d0b9c01.avif?t=1787960089\" width=616 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into fast-paced dodgeball action with <strong>local and online multiplayer</strong>! Team up in <strong>2-player co-op</strong> to take on the game's challenges together, or settle the score in <strong>2-player versus mode</strong> where only the quickest, craftiest dodger comes out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodgeball Blast</strong> is an action-packed boss rush adventure game where your dodgeball skills will be put to the ultimate test! Face off against 10 wild and wacky bosses, each with their own unique abilities and personalities, as you fight your way to becoming the ultimate Dodgeball Master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>10 Unique Bosses – Dodge, Throw, Survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261250/extras/1fda88eb3a30d148fcca5c3d0f9ebb62.avif?t=1787960089\" width=616 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a <strong>wild lineup of over-the-top bosses</strong>, each with their own crazy attacks and unpredictable dodgeball skills. From a <strong>Bigfoot brawler on the wing of a plane</strong> to a <strong>Kung Fu Dodgeball Master</strong>, every fight is a ridiculous showdown!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Minigames – More Than Just Dodgeball!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261250/extras/476eb76f106b6f32f51a5fd6b144a81e.avif?t=1787960089\" width=616 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the chaos with a variety of <strong>wacky minigames</strong> that test your reflexes, aim, and dodging prowess. Can you master the art of extreme dodgeball trick shots?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlockable Abilities – Power Up Your Game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261250/extras/3eaaa8ca4390de56680a8f8c87f88ccd.avif?t=1787960089\" width=616 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, <strong>earn and equip new abilities</strong> to enhance your dodgeball domination. Super-ninja speed, boomerang throws, and other insane skills will change how you take on the competition!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Local &amp; Online Multiplayer – Team Up or Throw Down!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261250/extras/54832815b23b672f53fb7aaf5d0b9c01.avif?t=1787960089\" width=616 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into fast-paced dodgeball action with <strong>local and online multiplayer</strong>! Team up in <strong>2-player co-op</strong> to take on the game's challenges together, or settle the score in <strong>2-player versus mode</strong> where only the quickest, craftiest dodger comes out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dodgeball Blast is a lighthearted, action-packed 